                <pb facs="0261" n="229" sameAs="frus:frus1964-68v18/pg229"/>

                <head>100. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>National Intelligence Estimate 4–2–64, “Prospects for a Proliferation of Nuclear
                    Weapons Over the Next Decade,” October 21, 1964, estimated the capabilities and
                    intentions of additional countries to develop and produce nuclear weapons over
                    the next decade and the <pb facs="0262" n="230" xml:id="pg230"/> consequences if
                    they did so. [<hi rendition="#italic">text not declassified</hi>] (Central
                    Intelligence Agency, Job 79–R01012A, ODDI Registry of NIE and SNIE Files)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
